# graycode-skills environment variables (all optional).
# This repository has no network service and reads no secrets.

# Where `./setup --host rho` copies skills: <RHO_STATE_DIR>/skills. Leave unset
# to use Rho's default state directory ($XDG_STATE_HOME/rho, else
# ~/.config/rho/state on Linux or ~/Library/Application Support/rho/state on
# macOS). This is the same variable Rho itself reads.
# RHO_STATE_DIR=
